abstract: >-
  Final-Theory Bench compiles finite strong-operator quantum
  sequential-growth relations and verifies exact symbolic claims with
  hash-bound SageMath and Singular certificates. Version 0.3.9 carries
  forward the v0.3.7 Q1-through-Q4 commutativity theorem for nonsingular
  solutions of the literal frozen n<=4, d=2 system, keeps the v0.3.8
  canonical-LF compatibility bridge for the historical CRLF raw-byte
  digests, and makes the frozen-baseline audits resolvable from a clone
  rather than only on the authoring machine. Neither 0.3.8 nor 0.3.9
  changes a scientific verdict; the unrestricted-theory boundary is
  unchanged.
keywords:
  - causal sets
  - quantum sequential growth
  - computer-assisted proof
  - exact symbolic computation
  - Groebner bases
